{"id":"pokolenie","lemma":"поколение","pos":"noun","rank":2744,"glosses":["generation, age"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ee/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"поколения","plural":"поколения"},"examples":[{"text":"Я не понимаю вашего поколения.","en":"I don't understand your generation.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I don't understand"]]},{"text":"Ты из другого поколения!","en":"You're from a different generation.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,null]},{"text":"Молодое поколение иначе смотрит на вещи.","en":"The younger generation looks at things differently.","words":[{"g":"young","l":"молодой"},null,null,{"g":"to look, to gaze","l":"смотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"thing, object","l":"вещь"}]},{"text":"Мать и дочь представляли два поколения.","en":"The mother and daughter represented two generations.","words":[{"g":"mother"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"daughter"},{"g":"to present, to offer","l":"представлять"},{"g":"two"},null]},{"text":"Вы из другого поколения!","en":"You're from a different generation.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"from / out of"},null,null]}]}